{"v":4,"catch":"緊急命令！殲滅所有敵人！","desc":"《QUESTER》是NAMCO LIMITED（現稱Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1987年推出的打磚塊遊戲。\n玩家需駕駛太空船擊敗阻擋去路的神秘太空生物（磚塊），安全返回地球。\n當球體持續撞擊牆壁時，可分裂成多個碎片。善用各類強化道具，挑戰通關全部33關的目標！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2026-01-29","genres":["街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/99b7be3b1b12e6b4f55a5c29f645adb33852cf75d322bc53f6cce72ef39e5d50.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5b60a30bcb488c3ed6d1c7b55945bb6e1b47e2823f6fedbd989ce899a76f508d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/85b910fa85177b94f4f64fdf091ad8f7e49f0e765dd06aa1c013f57baa39629b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d64fd96e8611a2c8ed3799680b3987f515e000b9f9d5e1aabe71d8358cdde02f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e0bb464c67ca3e0a0690614d529aefbf54f871061c5eb8777405edf9f87e05b4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f1a2595ef72d6069dad981fe2fba54997ef48342594ccc1ea97a2025cd03bd31.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ce60261e4000","dlc":[]}